    /// change will be immediately represented on the display. SDL_SetCursor(NULL) can be used to force cursor redraw,
    /// if this is desired for any reason.
    /// </para>
    /// <para>Thread safety: This function should only be called on the main thread.</para>
    /// <para>This function is available since SDL 3.2.0.</para>
    /// <para>See also: <c>SDL_GetCursor</c>.</para>
    /// </remarks>
